{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/246aad08c67ab464e92cec296dba31bc.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/246aad08c67ab464e92cec296dba31bc.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aASA'S ADVENTURE\u300b is a puzzle game with a pure hand-drawn art style. It is a journey about seeking, love, and being loved.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, after human civilization suddenly vanished, the protagonist Asa wakes up in an abandoned cave deep within an underground world. He does not know his age, where he is, why he came here, and even his body seems to have become smaller. Around him lie abandoned factories, caves, pipelines, and old-era buildings. Amidst all these mysteries, he finds a mysterious compass on him, as if it is guiding his way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/893c82ec438111c74fc602828624335b.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/893c82ec438111c74fc602828624335b.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/893c82ec438111c74fc602828624335b.mp4?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0655b5f6cd446a1c53e7388673444c61.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0655b5f6cd446a1c53e7388673444c61.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0655b5f6cd446a1c53e7388673444c61.mp4?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can search for and collect stars to unlock hidden storylines. The stars are hidden inside treasure chests, each with a different unlocking method (puzzle). The key to solving these puzzles is also linked to the hints of each star. Find the chests and try to open them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/4a4b09dc64403dba97d11f51d7c94eb9.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/4a4b09dc64403dba97d11f51d7c94eb9.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/4a4b09dc64403dba97d11f51d7c94eb9.mp4?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He travels through winding caves and arrives at a plaza of an underground city. There seems to be no trace of human life here; instead, various animals such as moles live here. To proceed to the next area, he must collect three chestnuts for the gatekeeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0df2d67bf3e261f26687c01f0282c582.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0df2d67bf3e261f26687c01f0282c582.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/0df2d67bf3e261f26687c01f0282c582.mp4?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there other people in this world besides Asa? What do these strange words mean? Where does the compass lead? Is anyone there? With these questions, players will follow Asa\u2019s perspective to explore and uncover this post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/6960b486dee1428d33635130e5ad8ad1.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/6960b486dee1428d33635130e5ad8ad1.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it is a ruined world, \u300aASA'S ADVENTURE\u300b is not full of despair. The game contains no bloody scenes. With delicate hand-drawn visuals, it will guide you to explore this forgotten world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/155a0a7656cdc1179ee7894fdbea49ca.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=865 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Someday,<br>you'll find<br>your very own star.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2605</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032860?t=1773650225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/3341102853443601133769c9f6fbe9f0266ae1f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773650225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/d9845cdca5e7b7a53ab85ea3ba5032faacdf35b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773650225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/d9845cdca5e7b7a53ab85ea3ba5032faacdf35b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773650225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/246aad08c67ab464e92cec296dba31bc.poster.avif?t=1773650225\" width=1080 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032860/extras/246aad08c67ab464e92cec296dba31bc.webm?t=1773650225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aASA'S ADVENTURE\u300b is a puzzle game with a pure hand-drawn art style. It is a journey about seeking, love, and being loved.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, after human civilization suddenly vanished, the protagonist Asa wakes up in an abandoned cave deep within an underground world. He does not know his age, where he is, why he came here, and even his body seems to have become smaller. Around him lie aban